  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A dual-ended brush with ultra-soft, vegan bristles designed to enhance, define, and diffuse cream or powder formulas into the hollows of the face.</p><p><strong><br>Brush Formulation:</strong> All Formulas</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Brush Coverage:</strong> Buildable</p><p><strong><br>Bristle Type:</strong> Synthetic</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> It is vegan and cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> This brush is a tool for precision and versatility. Use the angled tip for targeted sculpting or crease definition and the domed end to blend and blur with ease. Designed to follow the contours of your face, this brush transforms any product into a seamless extension of your vision.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Use the angled side to sculpt and define with creams or powders. <br>-Use the domed side to blend and diffuse creams or powders.</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A dual-ended brush with ultra-soft, vegan bristles designed to enhance, define, and diffuse cream or powder formulas into the hollows of the face.</p><p><strong><br>Brush Formulation:</strong> All Formulas</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Brush Coverage:</strong> Buildable</p><p><strong><br>Bristle Type:</strong> Synthetic</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> It is vegan and cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> This brush is a tool for precision and versatility. Use the angled tip for targeted sculpting or crease definition and the domed end to blend and blur with ease. Designed to follow the contours of your face, this brush transforms any product into a seamless extension of your vision.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Use the angled side to sculpt and define with creams or powders. <br>-Use the domed side to blend and diffuse creams or powders.</div></details>",
